    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d724">

                <pb facs="1076" n="1058" sameAs="frus:frus1946v05/pg1058"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/3–2046: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-03-20T18:00:00+01:00">March 20, 1946—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 20—5:51 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1349. Department 1260, March 19. I handed our reply to Bidault on the Spanish
                    situation and brought out orally the points set out in Dept’s 1261, March 20
                        [<hi rendition="#italic">19</hi>]. He is very much perturbed because he does
                    not know what to do. He says he will do the best he can to avoid the issue
                    [being?] placed before the Security Council but Bogomolov<anchor n="54"
                        xml:id="d724-f1"/> has been trying to see him for some days and he will be
                        <pb facs="1077" n="1059" xml:id="pg1059"/> compelled to receive him within
                    the next few days and he is sure Bogomolov will press him for early Security
                    Council action. He pathetically asks for suggestions. Bidault is well aware that
                    he has gotten himself into a jam and is most anxious to get out of it.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d724-f1" n="54" xml:id="d724-f1-content">
                <p>Alexander Efremovich Bogomolov, Soviet Ambassador in France.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
